# depth.steps: the shell with deep output asked for (MORF_DEPTH=10 in
# MORF_ENV; MORF_GPU_LOG=1 too, for what the compositor advertised).
# OUT/shell.log says what each surface presents as; the shots must look as
# they do at eight bits.
wait 6
shot bar
open launcher
wait 2
shot launcher
close
open controls
wait 2
shot controls
close
